  description: 'You can Ritual Summon this card with "Good & Evil in the Burning
    Abyss". Must be Ritual Summoned, and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways.
    Once per turn, during either player''s turn: You can send 1 "Burning Abyss" monster
    from your hand to the Graveyard, then target 1 face-up monster your opponent
    controls; until the end of this turn, that target loses ATK and DEF equal to
    the ATK and DEF of the "Burning Abyss" monster sent to the Graveyard this way.
    If this card is sent from the field to the Graveyard: You can target 1 card on
    the field; send it to the Graveyard.'
